anchor     functions/setsockopt.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/V2_chap02.html#2.10.16
class      required
since      2001
says       SO_LINGER set to {on, 3 seconds} on a new TCP socket reads back
           with a non-zero l_onoff and l_linger 3 (the length given and
           returned is that of struct linger), and set to {off, 0} reads
           back off.
test       t/004-linger.c

