assertion  XSH.setsockopt.009
anchor     functions/setsockopt.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/V2_chap02.html#2.10.16
class      required
since      2001
says       SO_RCVTIMEO set to 1.5 seconds on an AF_UNIX stream socket reads
           back as a struct timeval no smaller than that (it may have been
           rounded up); a set that fails with ENOPROTOOPT or EINVAL leaves
           the test not in use because the page leaves open whether the
           option can be set.
test       t/009-rcvtimeo.c

assertion  XSH.setsockopt.010
anchor     functions/setsockopt.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/V2_chap02.html#2.10.16
class      required
