assertion  XSH.setsockopt.019
anchor     functions/setsockopt.html#ERRORS/EINVAL
class      required
since      2001
says       setsockopt() on a connected TCP socket that has been shut down in
           both directions fails with EINVAL (or ENOPROTOOPT if the system
           does not support the option, SO_KEEPALIVE, at all).
test       t/019-shutdown-einval.c

assertion  XSH.setsockopt.020
anchor     functions/V2_chap02.html#2.10.20
class      conditional
when       IP6
since      2001
says       IPV6_UNICAST_HOPS on an AF_INET6 socket: 5 reads back as 5, -1
           is accepted, and 256 and -2 are rejected with EINVAL.
test       t/020-v6-unicast-hops.c

