assertion  XSH.setsockopt.023
anchor     functions/setsockopt.html#DESCRIPTION
class      untestable
since      2001
reason     the behaviour of setsockopt() for SO_ACCEPTCONN, SO_ERROR and
           SO_TYPE is stated as unspecified
says       setsockopt() with SO_ACCEPTCONN, SO_ERROR or SO_TYPE has
           unspecified behaviour.
